<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aaa rating to NTT Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aaa rating to NTT Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Tuesday that it had assigned an Aaa rating to Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp's (NTT) 250 million sterling 7.375 percent Eurobond issue due 2003.</p>
</text>
